<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 2.27 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 2.27 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 2.27 billion</p>
<p>zlotys worth of Polish T-bills at Monday's 1.3 billion zloty</p>
<p>primary tender, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>    T-bill	Demand	Offer</p>
<p>    13-week     513.84	400.00</p>
<p>    26-week     562.56	300.00</p>
<p>    52-week   1,197.50	600.00</p>
<p>NOTE. All amounts in millions of zlotys. Full details of the</p>
<p>tender should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
